<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-h2 tt-isec__h">Trip types and starting prices</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tt-ilede tt-ilede--sm"} -->
<p class="tt-ilede tt-ilede--sm">We organise four formats of educational travel tailored to different age groups and budgets. Day field trips by coach start from forty-two euros per student, offering focused off-site study days. Two-night residentials by coach start from two hundred and sixty-five euros, ideal for middle-school independence. Three-night coach and ferry tours start from four hundred and ten euros, while four-night study tours by air start from six hundred and ninety euros. Five-night tours start from eight hundred and forty euros, and seven-night language weeks with host families start from one thousand one hundred and ninety euros.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

